{"title":"Scorpion Carapace","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Deathstalker Scorpion, Rock Scorpion, Dune Scorpion, Sandmaw</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sandmaw\" title=\"Sandmaw - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/71ef30748f26ec05087c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sandmaw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"rock-scorpion\" title=\"Rock Scorpion - dropped it in 9 of 15 looted corpses (1/1.7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/5fab85beeea545234ca0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rock Scorpion</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"deathstalker-scorpion\" title=\"Deathstalker Scorpion - dropped it in 16 of 28 looted corpses (1/1.8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/53fd415b972a02d5f9d9.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deathstalker Scorpion</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1–12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-scorpion\" title=\"Dune Scorpion - dropped it in 7 of 16 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7850b285aa7a06eea064.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Scorpion</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–3</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scorpion-carapace\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/carapace-feet\">Carapace Feet</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 16</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/carapace-arms\">Carapace Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 18</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/carapace-head\">Carapace Head</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 20</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/carapace-legs\">Carapace Legs</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 22</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/carapace-torso\">Carapace Torso</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Armor Smithing 26</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/29de9072db7d3b475f5a.svg\" alt=\"Scorpion Carapace\"></div><h3>Scorpion Carapace</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>5 recipes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/23/2026, 9:23:10 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}